    "title": "Chamet - Live Video Chat",
    "description": "Chamet is a popular online video chat app and platform where you can enjoy 1-on-1 live video chat, or watch great live streams...\r\n\r\nBeing a LIVE social community with users in more than 150 countries, Chamet allows you to make friends world wide, video call with friends, live chat with people from nearby, or go live to become an influencer!\r\n\r\nWhy Chamet?\r\n\ud83e\udd33 Live Video Chat\r\nYou can invite a friend to start a 1v1 live video chat or create a live chat room with up to 9 people.\r\n\r\nWanna to chat with random people? Nearby Live video call would be your perfect choice. Speak out freely in live video call without any burden. Chamet - Online video call app with friends worldwide.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf9 Live Streaming\r\nStream your special moments, watch content you\u2019ll love, and live video chat with your favorite Creators. Chamet is the Live Stream app just for you.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc83 Go Live\r\nGain fans receive gifts, and make friends here through showing your talent. Go live and become a creator! Even PK with friends.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0f Live Talk Globally\r\nChamet allows you to live talk and connect with people from around the world and discover a diverse, creative community. Join and start live talking NOW!\r\nChamet is a Live video calling app to join the live stranger's community and chill out with them.\r\n\r\nChamet is the ultimate platform to make real connections, engage in live video chats and live talk with random.\r\n\r\nContact Us\r\nIf you want to be our streamers or agents: bd@hkfuliao.com\r\nIf you have any questions when using the app: chametservice@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Chamet is a popular online video chat app and platform where you can enjoy 1-on-1 live video chat, or watch great live streams...<br><br>Being a LIVE social community with users in more than 150 countries, Chamet allows you to make friends world wide, video call with friends, live chat with people from nearby, or go live to become an influencer!<br><br>Why Chamet?<br>\ud83e\udd33 Live Video Chat<br>You can invite a friend to start a 1v1 live video chat or create a live chat room with up to 9 people.<br><br>Wanna to chat with random people? Nearby Live video call would be your perfect choice. Speak out freely in live video call without any burden. Chamet - Online video call app with friends worldwide.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf9 Live Streaming<br>Stream your special moments, watch content you\u2019ll love, and live video chat with your favorite Creators. Chamet is the Live Stream app just for you.<br><br>\ud83d\udc83 Go Live<br>Gain fans receive gifts, and make friends here through showing your talent. Go live and become a creator! Even PK with friends.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0f Live Talk Globally<br>Chamet allows you to live talk and connect with people from around the world and discover a diverse, creative community. Join and start live talking NOW!<br>Chamet is a Live video calling app to join the live stranger&#39;s community and chill out with them.<br><br>Chamet is the ultimate platform to make real connections, engage in live video chats and live talk with random.<br><br>Contact Us<br>If you want to be our streamers or agents: bd@hkfuliao.com<br>If you have any questions when using the app: chametservice@gmail.com",
